source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "String::from_utf8(out.stdout).unwrap()"
---
Add and list reminders

Usage: jot task [OPTIONS] [TITLE]
       jot task <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add   Add a reminder
  list  List reminders [alias: ls]
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Arguments:
  [TITLE]  Add a reminder with this title (same as `jot task add`)

Options:
      --json                 Print JSON instead of text
  -d, --due <DUE>            Due date, such as today or 2026-11-03
  -p, --priority <PRIORITY>  [possible values: low, medium, high]
  -h, --help                 Print help
